WEBVTT

00:07:59.515 --> 00:08:00.737
(Applause)

00:08:00.761 --> 00:08:04.361
That is the truth and that is the dare.

00:08:04.385 --> 00:08:08.244
The first step is to recognize
that we have a problem.

00:08:08.268 --> 00:08:10.908
(Laughter)

00:08:12.586 --> 00:08:15.309
A lot of people tend to think
that good design

00:08:15.333 --> 00:08:16.670
is just a matter of taste,

00:08:16.694 --> 00:08:19.716
and quite honestly,
sometimes it is, actually,

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:22.121
but sometimes it isn't, all right?

00:08:22.145 --> 00:08:23.295
(Laughter)

00:08:23.747 --> 00:08:26.859
Here's the full list of NAVA
flag design principles.

00:08:28.328 --> 00:08:30.982
Narrator: The five
basic principles of flag design.